✊ Rock Paper Scissors Game

📌 Project Overview

Rock Paper Scissors is a simple and interactive browser-based game developed using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Players can compete against the computer by choosing Rock, Paper, or Scissors. The game automatically determines the winner based on the selected choices.

✨ Features

🎮 Interactive Rock, Paper, Scissors gameplay.

🤖 Play against the computer.

🎲 Random computer selection.

🏆 Automatic winner detection.

📊 Score tracking for both player and computer.

🔄 Play again functionality.

📱 Responsive and user-friendly design.

🛠️ Technologies Used

HTML5 – Structure of the game.

CSS3 – Styling and responsive design.

JavaScript – Game logic and interactivity.

🚀 How to Play

Open the game in your browser.

Select Rock, Paper, or Scissors.

The computer will randomly select its choice.

The game will display the result.

The score will be updated automatically.

Play again and enjoy!

